(text "Both open-drain outputs join HW_FAULT_N and asynchronously clear U503 through U507.\nFault release creates no RUN_SET edge: explicit ON is required for recovery.\nIndependent core OVP, control brownout, input eFuse FLT and physical STOP remain on sheet05.\nCore regulator intrinsic OVP/OC/OT protects Core without Pico; a regulator-only fault need not clear IO." (at 20 259 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5e9d8edf-1399-49a4-93e2-cd4c1e5490a9"))
